from mkchar import mk
mk("Marcus_Hargrave_Xenoria.md","Marcus Hargrave Xenoria","2","Book 10","Book 12","Books 10, 12 (chapter files)","Allayeth.md, Gormanston_Bynes.md, ../05_Organisations/Adventure_Society.md, ../06_Places/Yaresh.md",
"A massive leonid troubleshooter for the Adventure Society's continental council, sent to Yaresh to break the aristocrats' hold and an ally of Jason there.",
["Introduces himself as \"an adventurer and the man the Adventure Society saw fit to deploy to your city\" (Book 10, Ch47 L76); reads Team Biscuit's complaint and wonders if a familiar picked the name (Book 10, Ch47 L78).",
 "A massive leonid who carries a huge axe; \"a high-level agent of the Adventure Society's continental council, Marcus was a troubleshooter and enforcer\" (Book 12, Ch15 L76).",
 "He confronts Gormanston Bynes: \"I was warned that you might give me trouble\" (Book 10, Ch48 L10); his arrival and the support he wins from figures such as Gormanston leave the aristocrats scattered (Book 10, Ch58 L58-61).",
 "He is accommodating to Jason, which unsettles Jason's allies (Book 10, Ch50 L51; Book 10, Ch52 L4-6), and takes part in the Cardinas planning (Book 10, Ch59 L12; Book 10, Ch60 L13-46).",
 "In Book 12 he is dispatched to Yaresh again on hearing of Jason's return (Book 12, Ch15 L76)."],
"Booming, cheerful and blunt; his bluster hides a politician's skill with leverage.")
mk("Gormanston_Bynes.md","Gormanston Bynes","2","Book 10","Book 10","Book 10, Ch12-18, Ch47-48, Ch58","Marcus_Hargrave_Xenoria.md, Allayeth.md, ../06_Places/Yaresh.md",
"A gold-rank elf, leader of Yaresh's Aristocratic Faction and head of its civic administration, who is outmanoeuvred by Marcus Xenoria and Jason.",
["Allayeth describes him as one of the most prominent members of a powerful political faction in Yaresh; his son Calcifer is the man Jason sent running (Book 10, Ch14 L3).",
 "He has \"not a trace of monster core\" in his aura, is a gold-ranker with a broad, powerful frame unusual among elves (Book 10, Ch16 L62-63).",
 "He is the faction's chief standard bearer and new lead representative of the Yaresh civic administration (Book 10, Ch16 L61).",
 "He fears the elite's neglect of the foundations of their power and wanted a different crisis than the invasion he got (Book 10, Ch47 L60-63).",
 "His niece Juniper, twenty-two, reached silver during the surge (Book 10, Ch48 L4).",
 "He stands up to Marcus Xenoria in the Adventure Society hall (Book 10, Ch48 L9-10); the aristocrats' power is left scattered (Book 10, Ch58 L58).",
 "Allayeth says he hates weakness, is efficient at squeezing value from enemies and would use or ally with Jason (Book 10, Ch18 L133, L137)."],
"Proud, controlled and shrewd; he conceals contempt behind careful politeness.")
mk("Hess_Jor_Nasala.md","Hess Jor Nasala","3","Book 9","Book 11","Books 9, 10 (chapter files)","Jes_Fin_Kaal.md, Fal_Vin_Garath.md, ../02_Cosmology_and_Powers/Astral_Kings_and_Messengers.md",
"A silver-rank messenger, dark-skinned and silver-haired, who serves as Jes Fin Kaal's chief assistant and mouthpiece.",
["Kaal thanks him in front of Fal Vin Garath, and he sits beside them (Book 9, Ch56 L40, L75).",
 "He is described as \"dark-skinned and silver-haired\", subordinate to Kaal, who is gold rank and a Voice of the Will (Book 9, Ch66 L3).",
 "He advises caution (\"We cannot base our activities on doubts and assumptions\", Book 9, Ch56 L101) and names the Unorthodoxy when Kaal raises a problem (Book 9, Ch66 L39).",
 "In Book 10 he is Kaal's chief assistant and mouthpiece and relays the messengers' objections; he admits he would not fight Jason (Book 10, Ch16 L26-53)."],
"Deferential and careful; he speaks only when he has something worth saying (Book 9, Ch66 L41).")
mk("Marla.md","Marla","3","Book 10","Book 12","Books 10, 11, 12 (chapter files)","../04_Peoples_and_Cultures/Smoulder_and_Brighthearts.md, ../06_Places/Astral_Spaces/Transformation_Zones.md",
"A fire-aspect brightheart who commands the brightheart military defending Cardinas.",
["A fire aspect with skin markings, eyes and hair the yellow-orange of steel in a forge, dark-skinned (Book 10, Ch65 L9); in Book 12 her hair and eyes glow like molten steel and she has a warrior's physique (Book 12, Ch11 L6).",
 "She comforts Lorenn, the city's leader, when she breaks down (Book 10, Ch65 L24).",
 "She briefs Jason on the citadel's defences, the children kept in the growth chambers and the messengers' failed attempts to cross the death chamber (Book 10, Ch72 L28-38; Book 10, Ch73 L7-51).",
 "She commands the citadel's response when Gary drinks from the Cup of Heroes (Book 10, Ch88 L116) and coordinates reinforcements (Book 10, Ch89 L89-95).",
 "In Book 11 she is the brightheart commander beside the Builder cult's Beaufort (Book 11, Ch4 L21; Book 11, Ch17 L80); in Book 12 she is the leader of the brightheart military (Book 12, Ch11 L6)."],
"Commanding and practical; she answers loss with order.")
